RrbUZUOEQ4dHhTOVNQZXZSRThLVUdLOGRhZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"JDE Peet 交易後，Keurig Dr Pepper 銷售額躍升 70.6% 至 $7.34B"},{"title":"Keurig Dr Pepper Coffee Concerns Persist, But Outlook Remains Positive, UBS Says","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNNFNaSDJCREpzNWEtcC1SS0pidW00VFNsTlotcFloVzEtd1FGSFY0Vi1kUWF3MVJtNHl2M1dTdV8yekRHbWhoZ0tzZmxhMHY4NTZleVhNd0NxRk1PT1ZuTW9aMDFuc1prNFVDUC1wODJfUFlZQXQyWUMwd01RTGhEbGlVeWtEUFdLTnhjVmQ3c2lyMEZHdmVDczY2UEZwZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"瑞銀表示，Keurig Dr Pepper Coffee 的擔憂依然存在，但前景依然樂觀"},{"title":"Keurig Dr Pepper Reports Q3 Results and Reaffirms Guidance for 2026","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPb2NGbVZaYlRhYm9iYVFUM1Fubk4wTXR6V1BjVmN1eHRjMlR0UGVCZDM0ZnZ1bEY1TlhqbldMWXVSMWNWU20zRmdnakFYUVFDVE1nakdBRkw5NmEyTEgtcWZBWG9kNXRVMUF1bjJJamNxRFgtX0Z0NVI0dVIxZEQ2NW5rR1YtSG1mUTZsQXdYdk50NmxpRm05OUxiMXJROUxwSkFKOHY4ZVV2NFdld1FySjE1VGZSb09IekJfMmktMnNrYnpHejJF?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"Keurig Dr Pepper 報告第三季業績並重申 2026 年指導"},{"title":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. Reaffirms Earnings Guidance for Full Year 2026","src":"www.marketscreener.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNZi02X0VianZSb1hGSkhKUjhlc3kzOERRaVRYeUtzb2VHLXFFdV82N085UG9qbEQwVUFpZXdEZW02emQ4MGp6LU9KVVFLOXEwVENZdDRhdXo0cDFIRjFabVVMbzl4TGxBMVZfOXh1VzA4YTBScUFhV1BxSjZqZ3dxaTBLclZhLTFmcXpKVjJrMGktczFKaE56eDJmMHlMTUxZOFFpLWxHa292MEN0M3ZidkpCVHpkZFoyQl9YWQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. 重申 2026 年全年獲利指引"},{"title":"Earnings call transcript: Keurig Dr Pepper tops Q3 2026 estimates, shares fall premarket","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"財報電話會議記錄：Keurig Dr Pepper 超出 2026 年第三季預期，股價盤前下跌"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1418135/000141813526000016/kdp-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. is a leading beverage company in North America that manufactures, markets, distributes, and sells hot and cold beverages and single serve brewing systems. We have a broad portfolio of iconic beverage brands, including Dr Pepper, Canada Dry, Mott's, A&W, Pe afiel, GHOST, 7UP, Snapple, Green Mountain Coffee Roasters, Clamato, The Original Donut Shop, and Core Hydration, as well as the Keurig brewing system. Our beverage brands are some of the most recognized beverage brands in North America, with significant consumer awareness levels and long histories that evoke strong emotional connections with consumers. We offer more than 125 owned, licensed, and partner brands, supported by powerful distribution capabilities.","zh":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. 是北美領先的飲料公司，生產、行銷、分銷和銷售熱飲、冷飲和單杯沖泡系統。我們擁有廣泛的標誌性飲料品牌組合，包括 Dr Pepper、Canada Dry、Mott's、A&W、Pe afiel、GHOST、7UP、Snapple、Green Mountain Coffee Roasters、Clamato、The Original Donut Shop 和 Core Hydration，以及 Keurig 沖泡系統。我們的飲料品牌是北美最受認可的飲料品牌之一，具有顯著的消費者認知度和悠久的歷史，能夠喚起與消費者的強烈情感聯繫。我們提供超過 125 個自有品牌、授權品牌和合作夥伴品牌，並擁有強大的分銷能力的支援。"},{"en":"KDP was created on July 9, 2018, through the combination of the business operations of Keurig, a leading producer of innovative single serve brewing systems and specialty coffee in the U.S. and Canada, and DPS, a company built over time through a series of strategic acquisitions that brought together iconic beverage brands in North America. Today, we trade on Nasdaq under the symbol KDP.","zh":"KDP 成立于 2018 年 7 月 9 日，由美国和加拿大领先的创新单杯冲泡系统和精品咖啡生产商 Keurig 和 DPS 的业务运营合并而成，DPS 是一家通过一系列战略收购建立起来的公司，汇集了北美的标志性饮料品牌。今天，我們在納斯達克進行交易，代號為 KDP。"},{"en":"Our strategic framework starts with our purpose to Drink Well. Do Good. We aim to enhance the experience of every beverage occasion and to make a positive impact for people, communities, and the planet. Our vision is to be a total beverage leader, offering a beverage for every need, anytime, anywhere. We support our purpose and vision with five key strategies:","zh":"我們的策略框架始於我們「喝得好」的目標。行善。我們的目標是增強每個飲品場合的體驗，並為人們、社區和地球產生積極影響。我們的願景是成為全面的飲料領導者，隨時隨地提供滿足各種需求的飲料。我們透過五項關鍵策略來支持我們的宗旨和願景："}],"markets":[{"en":"We are a leading integrated brand owner, manufacturer, and distributor of beverages in the U.S., Canada, Mexico, the Caribbean, and other international markets.","zh":"我們是美國、加拿大、墨西哥、加勒比地區和其他國際市場領先的飲料綜合品牌所有者、製造商和分銷商。"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, our operating structure consists of three operating and reportable segments: U.S. Refreshment Beverages, U.S. Coffee, and International. Segment financial data, including financial information about foreign and domestic operations, is included in Note 9 of the Notes to our Consolidated Financial Statements.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我们的运营结构由三个运营和报告部门组成：美国清凉饮料部门、美国咖啡部门和国际部门。分部財務數據，包括有關國外和國內業務的財務資訊，包含在我們的合併財務報表附註的附註 9 中。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Retailers include supermarkets, hypermarkets, mass merchandisers, club stores, e-commerce retailers, office superstores, vending machines, fountains, grocery and drug stores, convenience stores, and other small outlets. Retailers purchase finished beverages, K-Cup pods, appliances, and accessories directly from us. Our portfolio of strong brands, operational scale, and experience in the beverage industry has enabled us to maintain strong relationships with major retailers throughout the U.S., Canada, and Mexico. Our largest retailer, Walmart, represented approximately 16% of our consolidated net sales in 2025. Net sales to Walmart are included in all reportable segments.","zh":"零售商包括超市、大賣場、量販店、俱樂部商店、電子商務零售商、辦公超市、自動販賣機、噴泉、雜貨店和藥局、便利商店和其他小型商店。零售商直接向我們購買成品飲料、K-Cup 豆莢、電器和配件。我們在飲料行業的強大品牌組合、營運規模和經驗使我們能夠與美國、加拿大和墨西哥的主要零售商保持牢固的關係。 2025 年，我們最大的零售商沃爾瑪約占我們合併淨銷售額的 16%。沃爾瑪的淨銷售額包含在所有可報告部門。"},{"en":"In the U.S. and Canada, we generally grant manufacturing and distribution licenses for our CSDs to bottlers for specific geographic areas that are typically exclusive and long-term. These bottlers may be affiliated with Coca-Cola or with PepsiCo, or they may be independent. These agreements prohibit bottlers and distributors from selling the licensed products outside their exclusive territory and from selling any imitative products in that territory. Generally, we may terminate bottling and distribution agreements only for cause or change in control, and the bottler or distributor may terminate without cause upon giving certain specified notice and complying with other applicable conditions. These bottlers and distributor agreements may also contain provisions for fountain distribution rights, which are not exclusive for a territory, but generally do restrict bottlers from carrying imita","zh":"在美國和加拿大，我們通常會向特定地理區域的裝瓶商授予我們的碳酸軟性飲料製造和分銷許可證，這些許可證通常是專有的、長期的。這些裝瓶商可能隸屬於可口可樂或百事可樂公司，也可能是獨立的。這些協議禁止裝瓶商和分銷商在其專屬領土之外銷售許可產品，並禁止在該領土內銷售任何仿製品。一般來說，我們只能因某種原因或控制權發生變化而終止裝瓶和分銷協議，而裝瓶商或分銷商可以在發出某些特定通知並遵守其他適用條件後無故終止。這些裝瓶商和經銷商協議也可能包含噴泉分銷權的條款，這些條款並非某一地區獨有，但通常會限制裝瓶商攜帶 imita"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"U.S.Refreshment Beverages","val":10439000000,"zh":"美國清涼飲料"},{"name":"U.S.Coffee","val":3990000000,"zh":"美國咖啡"},{"name":"International","val":2174000000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":16603000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"LRB","val":11602000000,"zh":"LRB"},{"name":"K Cup Pods","val":3777000000,"zh":"K 杯豆莢"},{"name":"Appliances","val":646000000,"zh":"電器"},{"name":"Other Net Sales","val":578000000,"zh":"其他淨銷售額"}],"total":16603000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":14502000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2101000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":16603000000}},"peers":["MNST","MDLZ","LW","HRL","VRSK"]}}